  <item>
    <title>Vol_02_顶奢天花板：爱马仕如何用优雅横扫200年？「时尚编年史」2/5</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6758128e17cd5416adf80989</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6758128e17cd5416adf80989</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Dec 2024 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlHF8oelvbMZHuXPYGKW2oalYvus.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>“你知道</span><strong><span>世界上最贵的包</span></strong><span>是什么吗？其实，那只是爱马仕历史的一部分。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期《时尚编年史》中，我们将从19世纪的巴黎街头出发，追溯爱马仕从一间不起眼的皮具工坊，到成为全球奢侈品界标杆的200年传奇。这不仅是关于奢华与优雅的故事，更是手工艺、家族传承与创新精神交织的旅程。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>你将听到的精彩内容：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>马背上的起点</span></strong><span>：创始人蒂埃里·爱马仕（Thierry Hermès）如何从一块马鞍开启优雅之路？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>家族传承的坚守</span></strong><span>：六代人的努力如何让爱马仕保持独立精神，在奢侈品市场中屹立不倒？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>经典与创新</span></strong><span>：从拉链夹克到凯莉包，爱马仕如何将传统工艺与现代设计完美结合？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>独立的代价</span></strong><span>：与LVMH长达十年的股权之争背后，隐藏着怎样的商业智慧与坚持？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>可持续发展的探索</span></strong><span>：爱马仕如何用环保材料与修复工坊，为奢侈品注入时代意义？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>制作名单</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>策划与撰稿</span></strong><span>：文凌</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：张子文凌</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：张子</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>音效设计</span></strong><span>：张文</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>运营支持</span></strong><span>：张凌</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>封面设计</span></strong><span>：张子文</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期提问</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>奢侈品的价值究竟源自价格，还是工艺与传承？作为听众的你，又如何看待“奢侈”这一词？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区分享你的观点和故事！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>扩展阅读</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>相关资料</span></strong><span>：《奢侈：爱马仕总裁回忆录》《匠人精神：当手工艺品成为奢侈品》</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>推荐收听</span></strong><span>：Vol_01_从流浪到暴富！？来学学LV的传奇发家史「时尚编年史」1/5</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>下一期预告</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>E03. 香奈儿：一条小黑裙如何颠覆女性时尚？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>从一间小裁缝铺到自由与风格的象征，香奈儿如何在战火中崛起，又用优雅反击时代？敬请期待！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>互动方式</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>订阅播客</span></strong><span>：点击“订阅”按钮，不错过每期精彩内容！</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span>分享你的故事</span></strong><span>：在评论区留下你与奢侈品的关系，我们会在下一期选出特别留言进行讨论！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听平台</span></strong><span>：Apple Podcasts｜小宇宙｜网易云</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong><span>：官方邮箱：2464621523@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>社交媒体</span></strong><span>：微博、小红书、公众号、抖音</span></p>]]></description>
