  <item>
    <title>有涯｜古代没有网络，跨国生意怎么做？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6757eb4d17cd5416ade9c938</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6757eb4d17cd5416ade9c938</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 07:34:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>本期节目：福建离散人：中国商人跨洋的信任之道</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>简介</span></strong><span>：在没有网络的古代，福建商人依靠“同乡关系”跨越千山万水，把生意做到东南亚、加勒比海乃至加州。本期我们聊聊福建人如何通过信任编织出全球贸易网络，并探讨这种关系在当今的延续。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong><span>：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a></span></strong><span> – 没有合同，古代商人如何跨洋做生意？</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a></span></strong><span> – 福建人的全球足迹和“同乡网络”</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a></span></strong><span> – 福建农民的甘蔗种植技艺传播</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a></span></strong><span> – 政策限制与海外发展受限</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a></span></strong><span> – 从中间人到配角：殖民时代的转型</span></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a></span></strong><span> – 福建离散族群的故事与家乡情谊</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>互动问题</span></strong><span>：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>今天的“朋友圈”是否也像古代的“同乡网络”？你在生活中也有这种跨越时空的信任关系吗？欢迎留言分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>参考文献：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《贸易打造的世界》——（美）彭慕兰 史蒂文·托皮克</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFDKlTLA9aXlaG0-V9MjCQ69Msh.png"></figure>]]></description>
